# Security policy

## Supported versions

Only the latest release gets fixes.

## Report a vulnerability
{% if visibility == 'public' %}
Report it privately through
[GitHub](https://github.com/{{ github_owner }}/{{ project_name }}/security/advisories/new), not in a
public issue. Include the version, what you did, and what happened, and leave secrets such as
tokens and keys out of the report. You get a reply within 7 days.
{%- else %}
Open an [issue](https://github.com/{{ github_owner }}/{{ project_name }}/issues/new). The repository
is private, so only its collaborators see it. Include the version, what you did, and what happened,
and leave secrets such as tokens and keys out of the report. You get a reply within 7 days.
{%- endif %}

A fix lands on `main` and ships in the next release.
